mation\n- Industrial simulations with fluid effects\n\nEvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers. Our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, ensuring premium quality and marketplace-ready output designed to drive conversions and add-to-cart.\n\nWe create e-commerce listing videos that follow proven marketplace guidelines, showing the product within the first 3 seconds, delivering a strong visual hook, clear benefits, and real-life usage across multiple settings. Clean, platform-optimized visuals are designed for Amazon, Flipkart, Shopify, and D2C websites to drive higher add-to-cart and conversions. Shopify reports up to 28 percent higher sales for products showcased clearly on video, while Meta and Amazon emphasize benefit-led visuals for stronger purchase intent.\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films - Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for YouTube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 49, "view_count": 87, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yu5G0UKPbxA", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": ["AI ad film", "AI commercial", "AI generated video", "AI video production", "generative AI advertising", "CGI commercial", "CGI ad film", "VFX commercial", "VFX ad film", "virtual production ad", "no shoot advertisement", "virtual ad film", "digital advertising", "future of advertising", "AI marketing video", "brand film", "product ad video", "3D commercial", "synthetic media", "creative technology", "AI content creation", "next gen advertising", "AI powered ads", "virtual filmmaking", "AI visual effects"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "like_count": 2, "channel": "V4B-ai : We Create Videos Without Shoot ", "channel_follower_count": 98, "uploader": "V4B-ai : We Create Videos Without Shoot ", "uploader_id": "@v4b-ai", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@v4b-ai", "upload_date": "20260225", "timestamp": 1772011728, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "Yu5G0UKPbxA", "fulltitle": "3D Model